modelspec (github.com/modelspec-org/cli)

This product includes software derived from the SpecScore CLI
(https://github.com/specscore/specscore-cli), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0: the reading of ModelSpec HCL sources into concepts,
members and references (pkg/modelspec/hcl.go, model.go), and the rules for
name scopes, reserved names, duplicate concepts, enum values and reference
resolution (pkg/modelspec/check.go), which follow specscore-cli's
pkg/graph/model.go, lint.go and resolver.go. The derived code was rewritten
for a standalone tool; the rule semantics and several diagnostic messages are
kept.
